From: RyGT-Team
Subject: [PATCH] dinput haptic: an effect is running while DIEGES_PLAYING is set

SDL_DINPUT_HapticGetEffectStatus treated any nonzero status as playing. GetEffectStatus
can also report DIEGES_EMULATED, so an emulated effect that had stopped still counted as
playing. Only DIEGES_PLAYING means it is running (from ryGT7's SDL2 DirectInput patch;
merged with RyGTS's 0001 in FEAT-GTS-291).
---
diff --git a/src/haptic/windows/SDL_dinputhaptic.c b/src/haptic/windows/SDL_dinputhaptic.c
index 9caf2cc2d..e7ea21eef 100644
--- a/src/haptic/windows/SDL_dinputhaptic.c
+++ b/src/haptic/windows/SDL_dinputhaptic.c
@@ -1082,7 +1082,7 @@ int SDL_DINPUT_HapticGetEffectStatus(SDL_Haptic *haptic, struct haptic_effect *e
         return DI_SetError("Getting effect status", ret);
     }
 
-    if (status == 0) {
+    if (!(status & DIEGES_PLAYING)) {
         return SDL_FALSE;
     }
     return SDL_TRUE;
